                        "entry_id": "f3c9b141-60d6-3924-84d3-5d4069bd2c70",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. выданный, предоставленный, рассчитанный и т. п. на долгий срок"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9bc30666-af92-48c7-8e4e-3d765ea2f8c4",
                        "source_entry_id": "f3c9b141-60d6-3924-84d3-5d4069bd2c70",
                        "source_sense_id": "6901d7a2-eefb-34fd-8109-6087e783ee5b",
                        "target_lang_word": "long-term",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "long-term",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18374a89-5949-35cc-9109-ed51561402b6",
                                        "entry_id": "85750c0d-29c9-35ce-92b6-3576b6ed5219",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Becoming evident after a relatively long time period."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f9a70a25-351f-4b39-8702-b73420268624",
                                                "sense_id": "18374a89-5949-35cc-9109-ed51561402b6",
                                                "text": "Time will tell what the long-term impact of the Beijing Olympics will be. But history shows that once people get a taste of freedom, they eventually want more."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f2c31b5-abc8-4053-bdb8-ae5d460c3151",
                                                "sense_id": "18374a89-5949-35cc-9109-ed51561402b6",
                                                "text": "Surprisingly, this analysis revealed that acute exposure to solvent vapors at concentrations below those associated with long-term effects appears to increase the risk of a fatal automobile accident."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6bbea39-35fc-3751-84c4-a61d3dbccf06",
                                        "entry_id": "85750c0d-29c9-35ce-92b6-3576b6ed5219",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extending over a relatively long time period."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03d7c1d8-a8c0-4d9a-8a66-56ad1c0ef32a",
                                                "sense_id": "a6bbea39-35fc-3751-84c4-a61d3dbccf06",
                                                "text": "Furthermore, this increase in risk is comparable to the risk of death from leukemia after long-term exposure to benzene, another solvent, which has the well-known property of causing this type of cancer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80baedd6-4a68-417d-96d9-b14f4698c102",
                                                "sense_id": "a6bbea39-35fc-3751-84c4-a61d3dbccf06",
                                                "text": "Asari Cultural VI: Due to our lifespan-sometimes reaching 1,000 years of age-we are patient in our decisions, and prefer long-term solutions over short-term gains."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8686f8e-9dac-4c18-b56d-d5528bef079f",
                                                "sense_id": "a6bbea39-35fc-3751-84c4-a61d3dbccf06",
                                                "text": "Khan countered this by alleging that 'unfair' conditions, such as raising council tax, are being attached to any new funding deal that would \"punish Londoners\" for the effect the pandemic has had on passenger numbers. He added: \"These short-term deals are trapping TfL on life support rather than putting it on the path to long-term sustainability.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "long-term",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25d05db2-cb1e-3bcb-ad98-1920a72f8a53",
                                        "entry_id": "b17e69b7-fc5d-3bff-bf7f-6e9dc0be171c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Over a relatively long period of time."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17472d66-7d09-42ef-82e1-1e0448ae68d3",
                                                "sense_id": "25d05db2-cb1e-3bcb-ad98-1920a72f8a53",
                                                "text": "These alternatives to sugar, when consumed long term, do not serve to reduce body fat in either adults or children, the W.H.O. said in a recommendation, adding that continued consumption could increase the risk of Type 2 diabetes, cardiovascular diseases and mortality in adults."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
